  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Dual Attack. Must follow an off-hand attack. If it hits, Death Blossom strikes target foe for +20...40...45 damage and all adjacent foes take 20...40...45 damage.",
      "zhTW": "必須接續在「即刻攻擊」之後。命中時，死神之花對目標敵人造成 20～45 額外傷害，同時對所有鄰近目標的敵人造成 20～45 傷害。"
    },
